Hello neighbours! Do you know someone whose dog could use an extra walk? For example because walking is a bit harder, after surgery, or because the days are long.

Through {app}, a young person (18+) from the neighbourhood takes the dog for a regular walk, for free. The first time you always meet together, and you decide what is allowed. {app} never asks for money.

No smartphone? A family member or neighbour can sign the dog up for you, with your consent: {link}
